| Repository | Commit | Author | `origin/master` | `origin/main` |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| ooflash | `090c7e2` | reviewer | pushed | pushed |
| oobrowser | `af87654` | reviewer | pushed | pushed |
| oocanvas | `ec96e4c` | reviewer | pushed | pushed |
| oochat | `91536c5` | reviewer | pushed | pushed |
| oodaw | `a350d99` | reviewer | pushed | pushed |
| oodeck | `5f37a50` | reviewer | pushed | pushed |
| oosysbus | `d4fb1e4` | upstream (Devin) | already current | already current |
| oovfs | `31a9042` | upstream (Devin) | already current | already current |

Final state: all 8 repos `0/0` behind/ahead on **both** `origin/master` and `origin/main`, working trees clean. `origin/main`
was a strict ancestor of `origin/master` in the six app repos and was fast-forwarded; in oosysbus and oovfs `origin/main`
already tracked the upstream tip, so no branch was created or rewritten.

